      "(i sennui Panthael estathar aen) Condir",
      "i Drann, ar Meril bess dîn; ar Elanor,",
      "Meril, Glorfinniel, ar Eirien sellath dîn;",
      "ar Iorhael, Gelir, Cordof, ar Baravorn,",
      "ionnath dîn.",
      "A Pherhael ar am Meril",
      "suilad uin aran o Minas Tirith",
